ábeas Data y Tiempos Legales de Respuesta (SLA)","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Flujo Hábeas Data y Tiempos Legales de Respuesta (SLA)","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":15},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":1357856991,"isDeleted":false,"id":"qPBAPNkcHB2yaWqW","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":956.0,"y":3030.0,"strokeColor":"#334155","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":1043.0,"height":60.0,"seed":148800491,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"text":"• Flujo: Solicitud ──► Radicación Única ──► Identificación ──► Clasificación ──► Validación ──► Respuesta\n• Consultas y peticiones de información general: Término de 10 días hábiles (prorrogables 5 días).\n• Reclamos de protección de datos (Ley 1581): Término de 15 días hábiles (prorrogables 8 días).\n• Registro inmutable de PQRS archivado por 5 años para sustento probatorio ante la SIC.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"• Flujo: Solicitud ──► Radicación Única ──► Identificación ──► Clasificación ──► Validación ──► Respuesta\n• Consultas y peticiones de información general: Término de 10 días hábiles (prorrogables 5 días).\n• Reclamos de protección de datos (Ley 1581): Término de 15 días hábiles (prorrogables 8 días).\n• Registro inmutable de PQRS archivado por 5 años para sustento probatorio ante la SIC.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":12},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":207940598,"isDeleted":false,"id":"SPqCdUQRoQXb7jhq","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.0,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1830.0,"y":2415.0,"strokeColor":"#CBD5E1","backgroundColor":"#FFFFFF","width":1070.0,"height":760.0,"seed":62530871,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":757779374,"isDeleted":false,"id":"TQ0bt18bTSx7JwYJ","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1846.0,"y":2427.0,"strokeColor":"#64748B","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":519.0,"height":25.0,"seed":2010885082,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"text":"3. MATRIZ RBAC (LEAST PRIVILEGE) & MARKETING (LEY 2300)","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"3. MATRIZ RBAC (LEAST PRIVILEGE) & MARKETING (LEY 2300)","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":11},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":1066356060,"isDeleted":false,"id":"zoXCbc056E1aI37G","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.0,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.017453292500000002,"x":1850.0,"y":2460.0,"strokeColor":"#0C0C0C","backgroundColor":"#FFE95C","width":1030.0,"height":175.0,"seed":495197089,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":null,"boundElements":[{"id":"8XjXoE7OSfY2pPcU","type":"text"}],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":241976901,"isDeleted":false,"id":"8XjXoE7OSfY2pPcU","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.017453292500000002,"x":1850.0,"y":2494.85,"strokeColor":"#0C0C0C","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":1030.0,"height":105.30000000000001,"seed":1900371608,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":13,"fontFamily":2,"text":"MATRIZ DE PERMISOS POR ROL (LEAST PRIVILEGE):\n\n• Tutores: Solo acceden a estudiantes asignados y notas. CERO datos financieros ni teléfonos de padres.\n• Padres: Solo consultan avance y asistencia de sus propios hijos (CERO acceso a terceros).\n• Colegios B2B: Solo acceden al cohorte de su institución contratada.\n• Administradores: Acceso restringido por 2FA a finanzas, facturación y contratos.","textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"zoXCbc056E1aI37G","originalText":"MATRIZ DE PERMISOS POR ROL (LEAST PRIVILEGE):\n\n• Tutores: Solo acceden a estudiantes asignados y notas. CERO datos financieros ni teléfonos de padres.\n• Padres: Solo consultan avance y asistencia de sus propios hijos (CERO acceso a terceros).\n• Colegios B2B: Solo acceden al cohorte de su institución contratada.\n• Administradores: Acceso restringido por 2FA a finanzas, facturación y contratos.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":13,"autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":1577128930,"isDeleted":false,"id":"vrpGD7iDOP9NoO1P","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1850.0,"y":2655.0,"strokeColor":"#86EFAC","backgroundColor":"#F0FDF4","width":1030.0,"height":230.0,"seed":2005279367,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":715636517,"isDeleted":false,"id":"nq96Lbf6VlhrOpR8","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.0,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1864.0,"y":2667.0,"strokeColor":"#CBD5E1","backgroundColor":"#F1F5F9","width":167.20000000000002,"height":20.0,"seed":893627847,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":1037246766,"isDeleted":false,"id":"XBF8E1vIPNHHDYFp","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1868.0,"y":2669.0,"strokeColor":"#475569","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":203.0,"height":25.0,"seed":1558965731,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":10,"fontFamily":2,"text":"LEY 'DEJEN DE FREGAR'","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"LEY 'DEJEN DE FREGAR'","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":10},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":708751830,"isDeleted":false,"id":"FHfkehLrjIr0zH0F","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1866.0,"y":2691.0,"strokeColor":"#0F172A","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":851.0,"height":25.0,"seed":16153597,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"Régimen de Comunicaciones Comerciales y Marketing (Ley 2300 de 2023)","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Régimen de Comunicaciones Comerciales y Marketing (Ley 2300 de 2023)","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":15},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":647839477,"isDeleted":false,"id":"yANC3MTZZll33bKJ","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1866.0,"y":2715.0,"strokeColor":"#334155","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":1167.8000000000002,"height":60.0,"seed":1184733977,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"text":"• Separación estricta: Comunicaciones del servicio (clases, alertas) vs Marketing (ofertas y promociones).\n• Preferencias por canal registradas en base de datos: Email, WhatsApp, SMS y Llamadas telefónicas.\n• Horarios legales estrictos: Lunes a viernes de 7:00 a 19:00, sábados de 8:00 a 15:00. Prohibido domingos y festivos.\n• Mecanismo de cancelación en un solo clic ('Opt-Out') visible en todo mensaje comercial enviado.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"• Separación estricta: Comunicaciones del servicio (clases, alertas) vs Marketing (ofertas y promociones).\n• Preferencias por canal registradas en base de datos: Email, WhatsApp, SMS y Llamadas telefónicas.\n• Horarios legales estrictos: Lunes a viernes de 7:00 a 19:00, sábados de 8:00 a 15:00. Prohibido domingos y festivos.\n• Mecanismo de cancelación en un solo clic ('Opt-Out') visible en todo mensaje comercial enviado.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":12},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":360727107,"isDeleted":false,"id":"agyiPllA62Kzxa22","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1850.0,"y":2905.0,"strokeColor":"#CBD5E1","backgroundColor":"#F8FAFC","width":1030.0,"height":230.0,"seed":349821558,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":693787809,"isDeleted":false,"id":"Pv5IyuwyMtj9hV3m","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.0,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1864.0,"y":2917.0,"strokeColor":"#CBD5E1","backgroundColor":"#F1F5F9","width":167.20000000000002,"height":20.0,"seed":894053474,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":1183691778,"isDeleted":false,"id":"3jzT4TgVgdfBlGy1","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1868.0,"y":2919.0,"strokeColor":"#475569","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":203.0,"height":25.0,"seed":755000787,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":10,"fontFamily":2,"text":"PROPIEDAD INTELECTUAL","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"PROPIEDAD INTELECTUAL","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":10},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":1999481882,"isDeleted":false,"id":"Lr02LmBRyzbKIdlO","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1866.0,"y":2941.0,"strokeColor":"#0F172A","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":743.0,"height":25.0,"seed":350283713,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"Régimen de Propiedad Intelectual & Banco de Preguntas ICFES","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Régimen de Propiedad Intelectual & Banco de Preguntas ICFES","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":15},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":333049786,"isDeleted":false,"id":"lxsDJsAmX3SDMCiI","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1866.0,"y":2965.0,"strokeColor":"#334155","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":1129.4,"height":60.0,"seed":923077434,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"B4VDyCDDxtvvmwTE","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"text":"• Activos protegidos: Banco de preguntas ICFES, simulacros, guías pedagógicas, PDFs, videos y plataforma.\n• Prohibición expresa de copia, redistribución, reventa o extracción masiva automatizada (scraping).\n• Contratos de tutores con cláusulas de cesión patrimonial de derechos de autor y confidencialidad estricta.\n• Regla de Oro: El acceso al contenido académico NO equivale a transferencia de titularidad ni licencia comercial.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"• Activos protegidos: Banco de preguntas ICFES, simulacros, guías pedagógicas, PDFs, videos y plataforma.\n• Prohibición expresa de copia, redistribución, reventa o extracción masiva automatizada (scraping).\n• Contratos de tutores con cláusulas de cesión patrimonial de derechos de autor y confidencialidad estricta.\n• Regla de Oro: El acceso al contenido académico NO equivale a transferencia de titular